Hey [~accountid:6012ba2fa7fb40006901c930] 

Thanks for pulling together all the information in the document - appreciate it! 

Legal typically only gets involved once formal legal proceedings are issued. That said, I can see this particular passenger is being quite persistent, so I suggest we reaffirm our position and direct them again to the appropriate steps for obtaining the driver’s insurance. Please see a drafted response below for you to send, please insert the passengers name to the message. 

Once this is sent, I recommend any further messages be managed by the case managers and for a note to be added to the passengers account to avoid escalation.

[~accountid:5dde532fcdc2d20d05377446] [~accountid:5f17f7301084620015f4972a] - could you please add a note to the passenger’s profile, similar to how we’ve handled other sensitive matters? The goal is to manage communication carefully and avoid frustrating the passenger further.

At this stage, there’s nothing more we can do substantively, other than ensuring the messaging is consistent and calmly reinforces our position.

Of course, if this does progress to formal legal proceedings, Legal is happy to step in and support. Also happy to chat further if needed in the meantime.



