{color:#0747a6}Hi {color}{color:#0747a6}*[Insert Passengers Name]*{color}{color:#0747a6},{color}

{color:#0747a6}Thank you for reaching out and sharing your concerns - we acknowledge receipt of your message and the information you’ve provided.{color}

{color:#0747a6}As previously advised, if you wish to make a claim relating to this incident, the appropriate course is to contact the vehicle’s insurer, who will liaise directly with the driver.{color}

{color:#0747a6}You can obtain the following driver details from the journey summary email sent to the email address linked to your Bolt account:{color}

* {color:#0747a6}The driver’s name{color}
* {color:#0747a6}The driver’s private hire vehicle licence number{color}
* {color:#0747a6}The vehicle registration number{color}

