{color:#0747a6}Please note that Bolt drivers are independent contractors and are responsible for arranging their own insurance. Bolt is not affiliated with or responsible for providing drivers' insurance.{color}

{color:#0747a6}Should the police contact us as part of their inquiries, we will of course fully cooperate.{color}

{color:#0747a6}We take safety on our platform very seriously, and thank you again for bringing this to our attention.{color}

{color:#0747a6}Regards {color}

{color:#0747a6}Bolt {color}



If you have any questions please do not hesitate to reach out. 

